{"name": "Sky Harvest", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <strong>Sky Harvest</strong> is a cozy farming and life-sim adventure among the clouds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Grow crops, explore sky islands, and build your dream home in a peaceful world above the clouds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"505\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482840/extras/da382e758426430f586f900f7dc5448b.avif?t=1787308937\" width=\"1560\"/></span>A cozy life-sim adventure set in a breathtaking world of floating islands. <br/>Grow, explore, and connect with nature and its people as you shape your new home in the skies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"505\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482840/extras/f89783d4bceb00ba863ff4b52518580b.avif?t=1787308937\" width=\"1560\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Take to the skies aboard your trusty airship. Discover hidden islands, ancient ruins, and breathtaking landscapes filled with secrets and treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"628\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482840/extras/e9368d79d44ba5c89cbcfe7c79601c5f.poster.avif?t=1787308937\" width=\"1070\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482840/extras/e9368d79d44ba5c89cbcfe7c79601c5f.webm?t=1787308937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"505\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482840/extras/b2efa09b819b7d9bd005370f09169a0a.avif?t=1787308937\" width=\"1560\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Plant seeds, care for your crops, and bring life back to the land. From humble sprouts to lush fields \u2014 your farm will flourish among the clouds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"628\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482840/extras/7e494a4d25e67ec99d7a2f2a1637f5b6.poster.avif?t=1787308937\" width=\"1070\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482840/extras/7e494a4d25e67ec99d7a2f2a1637f5b6.webm?t=1787308937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"505\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482840/extras/8e431445289696db57c29dfdd85d2308.avif?t=1787308937\" width=\"1560\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Relax by crystal lakes, catch rare fishes, and gather ingredients for recipes and crafting.<br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"628\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482840/extras/baa442f408583e1e7c1400651270667b.poster.avif?t=1787308937\" width=\"1070\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482840/extras/baa442f408583e1e7c1400651270667b.webm?t=1787308937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"505\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482840/extras/ce1fbea25b641b56ad92cb6724d0803a.avif?t=1787308937\" width=\"1560\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Express your style with unique outfits and accessories. Be who you want to be in your skybound world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"628\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482840/extras/6fcd3c789d704de5887d9d3c700e36da.poster.avif?t=1787308937\" width=\"1070\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482840/extras/6fcd3c789d704de5887d9d3c700e36da.webm?t=1787308937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"505\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482840/extras/a15fbbfcb8134c376ec068e72c061446.avif?t=1787308937\" width=\"1560\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Meet charming villagers, share gifts, unlock heartwarming stories, and build meaningful connections across the islands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"628\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482840/extras/40cd8f448e5efe1a9a2d7d83e465b816.poster.avif?t=1787308937\" width=\"1070\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482840/extras/40cd8f448e5efe1a9a2d7d83e465b816.webm?t=1787308937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"505\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482840/extras/cb595d997096b467c352b90de44c3408.avif?t=1787308937\" width=\"1560\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Turn your harvests into delicious meals and serve travelers from across the clouds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"628\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482840/extras/9ca59be8b604afd12d2482641f5a16f5.poster.avif?t=1787308937\" width=\"1070\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482840/extras/9ca59be8b604afd12d2482641f5a16f5.webm?t=1787308937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"505\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482840/extras/dbe06920ba2e735ac0d3876d7e694fd4.avif?t=1787308937\" width=\"1560\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover, craft, decorate, and unwind at your own pace in this gentle, story-rich world above the clouds.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2692\ufe0f Crafting - Craft unique tools to enhance your day to day tasks. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \ud83d\udc9d Relationship Building - Make friends and unlock unique perks.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \ud83d\udd0e Quests - There's always something or someone in need of your help.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcb0 Merchant System - Buy and sell anything and everything through local shops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"125\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482840/extras/485823a987750306f8cdb2bb75b148c3.avif?t=1787308937\" width=\"1560\"/></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482840/extras/236d0a0541063ce4d6c555dfd3d6e2cb.avif?t=1787308937\" width=\"795\"/></span>Note from developer:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Please consider Wishlisting the game to support it and if you want to follow along with the progress of the game's development and other BTS, you can watch it on YouTube @hamzahgamedev.</p> </div>", "short_desc": "Armed with hand-me-down tools and some cash, you begin your new life as THE Chief Farmer, a position your grandfather once excelled in. Can you honor his legacy and transform the overgrown, untamed and desolate floating island into a flourishing farm abundant with produce?", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482840/d8da85f71b17388148ba6a5716eb3417655c6252/header.jpg?t=1787308937", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Early Access", "RPG", "Farming Sim", "Life Sim", "Exploration", "Relaxing"], "developers": "Armored Cat", "publishers": "Armored Cat", "release_date": "Jan 23, 2026", "price": "$7.99", "appid": "2482840", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "23 January 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/IpN9Ee03NlE", "first_seen": 1769126400.0, "review_rank": 1355}